 "This browser demo keeps OutBrick’s earlier sliding puzzle: move bricks out through matching gates, with unlimited undo here. It is a separate, simpler web game, not the iOS game; the iOS app adds matching, swaps, specials, goals and score-based stars.": "currentGameCopy · homeCopy · playCopy · page phrase",
