 "Version 5.1 brought Slide & Match to all 2,000 boards: twelve kinds of board; long, big, L and T bricks; a short card the first time you meet each new idea; VoiceOver slide actions; Community and Report a bug in Settings; and Settings in Liquid Glass. Version 5.1.1 fixes a tip card that could leave a board seeming frozen.": "currentGameCopy · page phrase",
 "Violet": "boardStrings",
 "VoiceOver names every brick by colour, shape and position and offers its slides and swaps as actions, such as “Slide left, out through the red gate”. It says where a brick stopped and what went home, and hints name slides as well as swaps. A two-finger double tap asks for a hint; rotors find specials, goals, blockers and gates.": "currentGameCopy · homeCopy · page phrase",
 "Walk a village": "homeCopy",
 "We looked in every row, under the undo button and behind Peach. The page you wanted isn’t here — it may have moved, or the link had a loose stud. No lives were lost.": "not-found",
